Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.74,0:00:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Mighty Little Defenders 11 – New Wild Cosmos.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Fishing in Troubled Waters
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.10,0:00:16.74,Title1,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}Episode 19
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.38,0:12:36.94,end,,0,0,0,,To be continued
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.93,0:00:23.01,Default,,0,0,0,,The little girl is yours; leave Blue Scarf to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.81,0:00:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.72,0:00:30.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I advise you not to resist, or you might get hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.08,0:00:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t move.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.31,0:00:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you waiting for? Go get him!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.85,0:01:03.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Attack!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.76,0:01:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait! That could hurt Xiao Mei.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.44,0:01:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you guys any good or not? Leave it to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.46,0:01:41.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait for my signal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.97,0:01:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Then run toward the back window.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.09,0:01:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.61,0:01:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll hold them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.72,0:01:53.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.78,0:02:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t even think about running.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.05,0:02:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me show you my true power.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.34,0:02:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Cha Erlang, what do we do now?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.13,0:03:00.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue Scarf has already been hit by the miasma; they won’t get far.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.94,0:03:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, I’m the only one with the antidote.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.50,0:03:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Does that mean I’ve been hit by the miasma too?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.49,0:03:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Cha Erlang, you didn’t even warn me beforehand!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.88,0:03:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest assured, this is an antidote for the miasma.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.32,0:03:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Just focus on your recovery while I go capture them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.12,0:03:22.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, hurry up and set out to catch them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.80,0:03:25.87,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as they are still in this desert,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.87,0:03:27.79,Default,,0,0,0,,they won’t be able to escape my grasp.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.65,0:03:48.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister, are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.29,0:03:51.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.87,0:04:10.95,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems the miasma is starting to take effect.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.95,0:04:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,They must be nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.25,0:04:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Assemble.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.44,0:04:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Blue Scarf is nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.24,0:04:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Take your communicators and get out to search.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.84,0:04:47.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Signal me when you spot Blue Scarf.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.59,0:04:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Can we handle it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.87,0:04:52.71,Default,,0,0,0,,We probably shouldn’t go in ourselves, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.59,0:04:55.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t worry; given her current abilities…
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.59,0:04:57.50,Default,,0,0,0,,…she poses no threat to you anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.90,0:05:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let’s get moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.26,0:05:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Wolffy, find a way to stay inside the combat vehicle.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.49,0:05:10.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.97,0:05:13.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if we rescue Xiao Mei now…
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.41,0:05:17.93,Default,,0,0,0,,…we won’t be able to escape Cha Erlang’s pursuit across this desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.24,0:05:19.48,Default,,0,0,0,,So what do we do?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.08,0:05:23.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a plan—we just need to take three steps.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.60,0:05:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you two whispering about? Hurry up and catch up!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.96,0:05:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.46,0:05:45.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.06,0:05:49.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn’t you run? It was a perfect opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.54,0:05:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Because you took care of me when I had a fever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.61,0:05:55.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I told you, that was just part of the mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.77,0:05:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,But you need help right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.97,0:06:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I don’t need anyone’s help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.75,0:06:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Look over here, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.23,0:06:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,They must be nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.90,0:06:27.58,Default,,0,0,0,,First, when they’ve battered each other in the chaos…
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.58,0:06:28.90,Default,,0,0,0,,…I’ll take Xiao Mei away while they’re distracted.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.17,0:06:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You two, go search up ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.32,0:06:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,If it were me…
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.86,0:07:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you standing there for? Go grab them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.10,0:07:11.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, she doesn’t have a weapon anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.38,0:07:12.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.16,0:07:29.20,Default,,0,0,0,,So Boss was right; she really can’t see anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.12,0:07:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Now we can settle the score for what happened before.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.14,0:07:36.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister, they’re coming over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.02,0:07:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,There’s nowhere left for you to run this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.34,0:07:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you betray us?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.89,0:07:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m sorry, but I’m one of the good guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.53,0:08:00.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I could never stoop to your level.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.37,0:08:06.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Boss, Weslie has turned traitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.51,0:08:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And the second step requires you to sabotage it from the inside,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.79,0:08:24.19,Default,,0,0,0,,to make sure this vehicle can’t move.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.38,0:08:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.78,0:08:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Weslie actually betrayed me?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.62,0:08:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I’ll make him see the consequences of betraying me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.41,0:08:40.33,Default,,0,0,0,,What’s going on? It’s stopped moving again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.61,0:08:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.96,0:08:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,After completing the first two steps, we’ll meet up at that location.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.20,0:08:55.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Now it’s time to find the meeting point.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.79,0:09:03.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand Xiao Mei over to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.39,0:09:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.54,0:09:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t fight! My mom said we should communicate properly when there’s a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.97,0:09:24.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.17,0:09:27.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Sister, are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.92,0:09:31.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Of all times for this to happen…
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.39,0:09:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,A sandstorm is coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.90,0:09:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is the vehicle breaking down again? It must be Weslie’s accomplice.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.54,0:09:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Quick, catch that Wolffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.73,0:10:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,A monster! A monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.37,0:10:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,My gear! You guys, hurry and help me catch it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.12,0:10:14.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything is going smoothly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.36,0:10:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m sure we’ll get Xiao Mei settled soon,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.52,0:10:17.76,Default,,0,0,0,,then find the rift,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.76,0:10:21.04,Default,,0,0,0,,and discover a way for me to return to normal so we can go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.06,0:10:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you taking me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.74,0:10:30.78,Default,,0,0,0,,After it! Get my gear back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.05,0:10:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Could this monster be here to snatch the fragment inside my gear?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.34,0:10:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Who else is after it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.74,0:10:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,The drone shows the fragment is nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.45,0:10:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,No one can stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.92,0:10:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,He has the fragment.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.96,0:10:57.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you keep chasing me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.56,0:10:59.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hand over the fragment you picked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.92,0:11:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You forced my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.07,0:11:06.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Let go of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.46,0:11:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you? Why do you want the fragment?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.30,0:11:22.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You aren’t worthy of knowing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.24,0:11:38.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.20,0:11:43.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t even think about escaping.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.06,0:12:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I’m done being a villain.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.02,0:12:06.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Don’t let me see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.29,0:12:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Let’s head to the next location.
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,------------------------------------------------------
